OL,5,
OL,6,FMs West died at the hospital in Bury St
OL,7,FEdmunds having initially presented with
OL,8,Fself-inflicted wounds to the abdomen
OL,9,Fshortly before 01:00 GMT on 18 January
OL,10,F2024.
